  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/IMG_1848.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;&agrave;rea d&#39;Educaci&oacute; de l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda ha organitzat un anys m&eacute;s l&#39;Escoleta de Pasqua, que en aquesta edici&oacute; s&#39;ha fet al col&middot;legi Miralcamp dijous 29 de mar&ccedil; i de dimarts 3 a divendres 6 de mar&ccedil;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/IMG_0538.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El parc del 8 de Mar&ccedil; s&#39;h aprofitat com a zona d&#39;esplai.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0523.jpg\" alt=\"img_0523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0524.jpg\" alt=\"img_0524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0525.jpg\" alt=\"img_0525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0526.jpg\" alt=\"img_0526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0527.jpg\" alt=\"img_0527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0529.jpg\" alt=\"img_0529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0530.jpg\" alt=\"img_0530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/escoletapasquaonda18/img_0531.jpg\" alt=\"img_0531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><